  "body": "On main (5fd2b93), the release heavy lane `stock_engine_agreement` fails 2 tests: `both_engines_judge_every_golden_program_alike` and `the_feed_sampler_reads_every_golden_program_alike`. They report 6467 FINDING lines where the column (Dexel) and field engines cut differently, for example `contour_disc_hole.cl` at (46.25, -4.25) and the `finish3d_scallop_plateau` bull-nose engagement.\n\nFound while gating PR #481 (#299); the output was identical before and after that change. PR #483 (#413, true XY arcs in the field engine) may close part of the gap; rerun after it merges.\n\nDone means: the lane passes on main, or each remaining disagreement is explained and the tolerance justified.\n",
